a:["$","main",null,{"dir":"ltr","children":[["$","$L24",null,{}],["$","$L25",null,{}],["$","$L26",null,{"articles":[{"id":"9404ae6b-db82-4018-9426-61a08ab929ea","seq_id":2,"art_code":"ART-002","slug":"unfulfilled-promises-therapy-resistance-passive-user","category_id":1,"category_title":"روابط","category_slug":"relationships","color_hex":"#f43f5e","sub_category_slug":"toxic-relationship-patterns","target_pattern":"abusive-or-controlling-dynamic","title":"Resistance to Therapy and Empty Promises: User Passivity and the Return of Destructive Patterns","summary":"In these cases, the partner has refused to accept therapy and, with promises of improvement, has reverted the relationship to previous destructive patterns. Faced with this situation, the user has remained passive and feels overwhelmed.","cover_image":null,"gallery_images":[],"sample_size":2,"negative_rate":"100.00","source_filter":{},"stats_snapshot":{},"translations":{},"is_published":true,"created_at":"2026-11-01T08:21:20.775Z","updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:17:18.497Z","current_lang":"en","available_languages":["fa","en"]},{"id":"c214f87d-d63a-4e65-8e79-d40ff35551c9","seq_id":1,"art_code":"ART-001","slug":"first-date-investment-rejection-analysis","category_id":1,"category_title":"روابط","category_slug":"relationships","color_hex":"#f43f5e","sub_category_slug":"first-date-rejection","target_pattern":"spending-on-first-date-followed-by-rejection","title":"First-Date Investment and the Consequences of Incompatibility: A Data-Driven Case Analysis","summary":"In this case analysis from the \"Zirogah Lab\" database, we examine the phenomenon of financial investment during a first online dating encounter and its aftermath. By focusing on a recorded experience that ultimately resulted in a declaration of incompatibility by the other party, we dissect the potential mechanisms behind this pattern and provide data-driven recommendations for optimizing early-stage relationship interactions.","cover_image":null,"gallery_